# LSHBL

This repository is only for the Lebanon & Sweet Home High School Bowling League.

- Do not commit to or push the WAHSB repository. Do not copy its Git history, secrets, student records, coach photos, or payment destinations.
- Do not publish student names, photos, scores, or guardian records.
- Do not invent sponsors, donations, events, fees, eligibility rules, or a contact email.
- Do not enable checkout, raffle sales, or a login until the league approves that system.
- Official logo files replace the temporary wordmark. Do not redraw or recolor supplied logo artwork.
- Public copy stays in `src/brand/organization.ts` instead of being repeated.
